"900.4.10(144)": {"explanation":"Exception RS 144 sets site specific rules for these RS lands: one semi-detached house per lot, the lot frontage that existed when the By-law was enacted, setbacks of 4.5 m front, 1.0 m on one side only, 3.0 m and 1.0 m on a corner lot and 6.5 m rear, 50 percent lot coverage, the required parking space in a building, a 6.0 m garage entrance setback, bay window projections up to 0.6 m and a 10.0 m height limit.","code_refs":"none"},
"900.4.10(142)": {"explanation":"Exception RS 142 sets site specific rules for these RS lands: one semi-detached or detached house per lot, the lot frontage and lot area that existed when the By-law was enacted, a 4.5 m setback from a side lot line abutting a street, a 2.4 m side setback and a 0.3 m garage setback from a side lot line that does not abut a street.","code_refs":"none"},
"900.4.10(222)": {"explanation":"Exception RS 222 adds no site specific provisions; Section 64.17(11) of former North York zoning by-law 7625 prevails on these lands and is not evaluated by the tool.","code_refs":"none"}
